      "text": [
        " : سَأَلْتُهُ عَنْ قَوْلِ اَللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ: ۝ أُحِلَّتْ لَكُمْ بَهِيمَةُ اَلْأَنْعٰامِ ۝ فَقَالَ \"اَلْجَنِينُ إِذَا أَشْعَرَ أَوْ أَوْبَرَ فَذَكَاتُهُ ذَكَاةُ أُمِّهِ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4175 - Umar ibn Udhaynah narrated from Muhammad ibn Muslim, from one of the Imams (peace be upon them), that he said: I asked him about the saying of Allah (swt), the Mighty and Majestic: \"Lawful to you are the beasts of cattle.\" (Surah Al-Ma'idah 5:1)\nImam (as) said: \"The fetus, if it has grown hair or fur, its slaughtering is the slaughtering of its mother.\""
        ]
      }
